        </view>
        <view class="rounded-[12px] p-[16px] border-[1px] border-solid border-[#e2e8f0] bg-[#ffffff]">
          <!-- 头部总缓存大小徽标 -->
          <view class="flex flex-row items-center justify-between mb-[10px]">
            <view class="flex flex-col">
              <text class="text-[14px] font-bold text-[#1e293b]">应用缓存与数据占用</text>
              <text class="text-[11px] text-[#64748b] mt-[2px]">
                文件 {{ fileCacheSizeText }} ＋ 存储 {{ storageSizeText }}
              </text>
            </view>
            <view class="px-[8px] py-[4px] rounded-[6px] bg-[#ecfdf5] border-[1px] border-solid border-[#a7f3d0]">
              <text class="text-[12px] font-bold text-[#059669]">
                合计: {{ totalCacheSizeText }}
              </text>
            </view>
          </view>

          <text class="text-[12px] text-[#64748b] leading-[18px] mb-[12px]">
            基于 uni.getFileSystemManager() 与 CACHE_PATH 读取、统计沙盒临时缓存并支持安全一键清理。
          </text>

          <!-- 缓存详情信息卡片 -->
          <view class="rounded-[8px] p-[12px] bg-[#f8fafc] border-[1px] border-solid border-[#e2e8f0] mb-[12px]">
            <view class="flex flex-row items-center justify-between mb-[6px]">
